   ],
   "italian": "il cane",
   "english": "dog",
   "hint": "",
   "details": "masculine · plural: i cani",
   "forms": "",
   "ipa": "/ˈka.ne/",
   "note": "Cagna = female dog. Attenti al cane = beware of the dog.",
   "fact": "It can also mean 'awful' after a noun: fa un freddo cane means it's bitterly cold. A bad actor or singer can also be called un cane.",
