    "— Benvenuti al Sud (2010), 0:09:55"
   ],
   "italian": "questo",
   "english": "this (one)",
   "hint": "",
   "details": "",
   "forms": "",
   "ipa": "/ˈkwes.to/",
   "note": "Agrees with its noun: questo, questa, questi, queste.",
   "fact": "It comes from Vulgar Latin *eccum iste, roughly 'look, that one'. The first part, eccum, also gave Italian 'ecco' ('here it is!'), so questo and ecco are related.",
   "facttitle": "Origin"
  },
  {
